    "summary": "Use this after the enemy shooter finishes in the opponent’s Shooting phase. Pick one of your Infantry units with the Leagues of Votann keyword that took a hit from the shooter. Choose a friendly Kapricus or a friendly Sagitaur no farther than 6″ from that Infantry. You can spend 2 Yield Points on this use to make a friendly Hekaton Land Fortress an alternative selection at the same distance. Resolve the selected vehicle’s shooting using your own phase’s procedure. Its models may fire exclusively at the original shooter, subject to target eligibility.",
